unfix           br
variable        ea equal pe/atoms
variable        a0 equal lx
variable        b0 equal ly
variable        c0 equal lz
print           "STABILITY alpha_E0_eV_per_atom $(v_ea:%.6f) box $(lx:%.4f) $(ly:%.4f) $(lz:%.4f)"
STABILITY alpha_E0_eV_per_atom -3.003905 box 22.5784 21.0462 24.1142
write_data      stability/alpha_relaxed.lmp
System init for write_data ...
clear

# ---- 1b. fcc Ga at 0 K (start from the potential's fcc reference lattice constant)
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
lattice         fcc 4.2469
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 4.2469 4.2469 4.2469
region          box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.2345 21.2345 21.2345)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 500 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.2345 21.2345 21.2345)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
mass            1 69.723
include         potential.mod
# Ga: 2NN MEAM, NIST IPR 2009--Do-E-C--Ga-In--LAMMPS--ipr1 (doi:10.1088/0953-8984/21/32/325801). Needs the MEAM package.
pair_style meam
pair_coeff * * potential/library.meam Ga In potential/GaIn.meam Ga
thermo_style    custom step pe lx press
fix             br all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.001
minimize        1e-12 1e-12 20000 200000
Neighbor list info ...
